    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.align\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.11.x\n\n### Description\n\nTrying to split with the pattern `--` throws a big error.\n\n### Reproduction\n\nThe issue can be reproduced via the following config:\n```lua\n-- Clone latest 'mini.nvim' (requires Git CLI installed)\nvim.cmd('echo \"Installing `mini.nvim`\" | redraw')\nlocal mini_path = vim.fn.stdpath(\"data\") .. \"/site/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim\"\nlocal clone_cmd = { \"git\", \"clone\", \"--depth=1\", \"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim\", mini_path }\nvim.fn.system(clone_cmd)\nvim.cmd('echo \"`mini.nvim` is installed\" | redraw')\n\n-- Make sure 'mini.nvim' is available\nvim.cmd(\"packadd mini.nvim\")\nrequire(\"mini.deps\").setup()\nrequire(\"mini.align\").setup()\n```\n\nOpen the following text file:\n```txt\nfoo--a\nfoobar--b\n```\n\nSelect both lines, and attempt to run `gas--<CR>`. Neovim throws a giant error:\n```\nE5108: Error executing lua: (mini.align) Pattern \"--\" can not advance search.\nstack traceback:                                                                                                                                                                                                \n        [C]: in function 'error'                                                                                                                                                                                \n        ...-repro/site/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim/lua/mini/align.lua:1924: in function 'error'                                                                                                                   \n        ...-repro/site/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim/lua/mini/align.lua:1535: in function <...-repro/site/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim/lua/mini/align.lua:1504>                                                        \n        vim/shared.lua: in function 'tbl_map'                                                                                                                                                                   \n        ...-repro/site/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim/lua/mini/align.lua:1497: in function 'action'                                                                                                                  \n        ...-repro/site/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim/lua/mini/align.lua:1451: in function 'apply_step'                                                                                                              \n        ...-repro/site/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim/lua/mini/align.lua:709: in function 'align_strings'                                                                                                            \n        ...-repro/site/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim/lua/mini/align.lua:1685: in function 'process_current_region'                                                                                                  \n        ...-repro/site/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim/lua/mini/align.lua:812: in function 'align_user'                                                                                                               \n        ...-repro/site/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim/lua/mini/align.lua:1380: in function <...-repro/site/pack/deps/start/mini.nvim/lua/mini/align.lua:1373>        \n```",
